    <briefdescription>
<para>A serializable vector of <ref refid="classfalcon__core_1_1physics_1_1device__structures_1_1Connection" kindref="compound">Connection</ref> pointers, also a Song. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classfalcon__core_1_1physics_1_1device__structures_1_1Connections" kindref="compound">Connections</ref> can be constructed in 5 different ways:</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Default constructor: creates an empty <ref refid="classfalcon__core_1_1physics_1_1device__structures_1_1Connections" kindref="compound">Connections</ref> container. <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classfalcon__core_1_1physics_1_1device__structures_1_1Connections_1a7c2bb6444502b2d47e23ff930154a65c" kindref="member">Connections</ref><sp/>o;</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Sized constructor: creates an <ref refid="classfalcon__core_1_1physics_1_1device__structures_1_1Connections" kindref="compound">Connections</ref> container with a given number of default-initialized elements. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>count</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of elements. <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classfalcon__core_1_1physics_1_1device__structures_1_1Connections_1a7c2bb6444502b2d47e23ff930154a65c" kindref="member">Connections</ref><sp/>o(10);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Fill constructor: creates an <ref refid="classfalcon__core_1_1physics_1_1device__structures_1_1Connections" kindref="compound">Connections</ref> container with a given number of copies of a specified value. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>count</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of elements. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>value</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Value to copy. <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classfalcon__core_1_1physics_1_1device__structures_1_1Connections_1a7c2bb6444502b2d47e23ff930154a65c" kindref="member">Connections</ref><sp/>o(10,<sp/>someConnectionsP);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Vector constructor: creates an <ref refid="classfalcon__core_1_1physics_1_1device__structures_1_1Connections" kindref="compound">Connections</ref> container from an existing vector of ConnectionSP. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>vec</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Vector of ConnectionSP to copy. <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">std::vector&lt;ConnectionsP&gt;<sp/>v<sp/>=<sp/>...;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classfalcon__core_1_1physics_1_1device__structures_1_1Connections_1a7c2bb6444502b2d47e23ff930154a65c" kindref="member">Connections</ref><sp/>o(v);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Initializer list constructor: creates a <ref refid="classfalcon__core_1_1physics_1_1device__structures_1_1Connections" kindref="compound">Connections</ref> container from an initializer list of shared pointers. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>init</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Initializer list of shared_ptr&lt;T&gt; to copy. <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classfalcon__core_1_1physics_1_1device__structures_1_1Connections_1a7c2bb6444502b2d47e23ff930154a65c" kindref="member">Connections</ref><sp/>o{ptr1,<sp/>ptr2,<sp/>ptr3};</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
